style="font-size: 10pt;">&#8195; </span><br/></div><div class="BRDSX_h1" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">(Name of Person(s) Filing Proxy Statement if Other Than the Registrant) </span></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 6.5pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Payment of Filing Fee (Check all boxes that apply): </div><table border="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-spacing: 0px;"><tr><td style="width: 20pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#9746;<br/></div></td><td style="vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-align: left;">No fee required. </div></td></tr></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-spacing: 0px;"><tr><td style="width: 20pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 1pt;">&#8201;<span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&#9744;</span><br/></div></td><td style="vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; text-align: left; font-size: 10pt;"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">Fee paid previously with preliminary materials </span></div></td></tr></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-spacing: 0px;"><tr><td style="width: 20pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 1pt;">&#8201;<span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&#9744;</span><br/><