><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 48pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 60pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 48pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;">2</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 120pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Ratification of the selection of BDO USA, LLP as our independent registered public accounting firm for the fiscal year ending December&#160;31, 2026.</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 156pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">&#8220;For&#8221; votes from the holders of a majority of shares present or represented by proxy and entitled to vote on the matter.</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 48pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Against.</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 60pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Not applicable.<sup>(1)</sup> </div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 48pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 120pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 156pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 48pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 60pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; padding-bottom: 1.38pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 48pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;">3</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 120pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Non-binding advisory approval of our executive compensation.</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 156pt; padding-top: 1.01pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">&#